pe":"twitter","url":"https://x.com/taolaunch"}],"cto":false},{"url":"https://dexscreener.com/ethereum/0xab8d6e8f0e7716bd951006cdcebee8b3bc08ffff","chainId":"ethereum","tokenAddress":"0xAb8d6e8F0E7716bd951006cDCeBee8B3bc08FFFF","icon":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/6j2Xp1r1jYcrKA7s?width=64&height=64&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","header":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/Gs6RwFRZqE00SIWV?width=600&height=200&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","openGraph":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/token-images/og/ethereum/0xab8d6e8f0e7716bd951006cdcebee8b3bc08ffff?timestamp=1790695500000","description":"Big brain, Big balls, Even bigger bags!\n\n$IP = Intelligent Portfolios, the token based on Blackrock's on-chain entry enabling BLKHIon, BRAINon, BLKGRWon to be accessed on chain. $IP token paired with $ONDO (The Ethereum layer for on-chain stock provision), enabling the hottest meme, of the biggest RWA narrative of the year to be born! \n\nWall Street is tokenizing everything. Stocks, treasuries, funds, all moving onchain. You could read the whitepapers. Or you could let the portfolio do the thinking while you watch the charts.\n\nMeet IP Wojak. Chief Intelligence Officer. Giant brain. Six monitors. Zero doubts. He doesn't pump. He increases intelligence. He doesn't dip. He has temporary cognitive decline. He never sells. Selling causes brain damage.\n\nLaunching on Fusi .ng, Ethereum. Liquidity locked. One pool live with $ONDO. Five more in committee (BLKHIon, BRAINon, BLKGRWon, YLD8on, ETH) as soon as liquidity becomes available, we are frontrunning the biggest narrative introduced to RWA and STOCKs to date. Tokens reserved to open each one with adequate depth + LP Fees from trading 1.1% will go to opening these pools with rewards from the new pool positions being used to buy back and burn $IP as part of a hexagonal arbitrage cycle when the assets become liquid enough on chain.\n\n$IP X $ONDO The intelligence layer for the onchain degen. Your portfolio has assets. Ours has an IQ.","links":[{"label":"Website","url":"https://ip.meme"},{"label":"Tweet","url":"https://x.com/Ondo/status/2103106602593087575"},{"type":"twitter","url":"https://x.com/ipdotmeme"}],"cto":false},{"url":"https://dexscreener.com/robinhood/0xf2ce99e627bf1535b2cb2cc4fdc2220415fc0ac7","chainId":"robinhood","tokenAddress":"0xf2ce99e627bf1535b2cb2cc4fdc2220415fc0ac7","icon":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/lci6pWMLh0mTQ_2T?width=64&height=64&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","header":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/JZWOY7kYVTw6atoY?width=600&height=200&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","openGraph":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/token-images/og/robinhood/0xf2ce99e627bf1535b2cb2cc4fdc2220415fc0ac7?timestamp=1790695500000","description":"▮ Confess nothing.\n\n$SHRIVE is a token on Pons with two doors. The first is the familiar one: buy $SHRIVE and claim your piece with your own wallet. Each piece is drawn fully on chain, a matte black lattice screen with one ember line and something dim behind it, a candle, a coin, a note or a key. One per wallet, one per buy, enforced by the contract.\n\nThe second door is the reason SHRIVE exists. Your browser makes a random code and only its keccak256 hash ever leaves. You pay in Zcash with that hash as the memo. A watcher built with librustzcash holds only a viewing key, so it can read the payment but never move a coin, and once it checks out the hash is reserved on Robinhood Chain. Later you commit, then reveal, and the piece mints to any wallet you choose for the small network fee.\n\nPlain limits: the operator sees amounts and memo hashes, and the claim is public on chain. The Zcash door opens after review, while the watcher is rebuilt for Ironwood and the claim step is hardened. The Pons door is open.\n\n▮ nothing on file","links":[{"label":"Website","url":"https://www.shrive.run/"},{"type":"twitter","url":"https://x.com/ShriveOrchard"}],"cto":false},{"url":"https://dexscreener.com/solana/cez8rebgixv6wpemw9bto